# ── Scripts directory (diagnostics / one-offs) ───────────────
# NOTE: bare "scripts/" matches any dir named "scripts" anywhere in the repo
# (backend/scripts, frontend/scripts, frontend/my-app/scripts, mobile/scripts,
# root scripts/) — that swallowed the real i18n pipeline/tooling in
# frontend/scripts, which is product code, not a one-off. Un-ignore it below.
# It also silently swallowed backend/scripts/encrypt_existing_data.py — the
# one-time FIELD_ENCRYPTION_KEY backfill script. It also silently swallowed
# mobile/scripts/ — the Android/iOS Detox E2E preflight + runner scripts
# (run-android-e2e.ps1, test-preflight-ios.sh, run-tests-ios.sh), which are
# real test tooling, not one-offs. Un-ignore all three real script
# directories; the root-level scripts/ (Claude session diagnostics) stays
# ignored via scripts/* above.
